  "id": "communication-apprehension",
  "term": "communication apprehension",
  "definition": "Communication apprehension is the degree of fear or anxiety a person feels about communicating with other people, whether the interaction is actually happening or only expected. In psychology and assessment contexts, it refers to worry about real or anticipated interpersonal communication.",
